  "_comment": "Hand judgement for B2 (content v68). All 502 items were read. The seed put every non-production item at 1, which made B2's scale dead across the whole level: a deduction modal and a vocabulary match both scored 1. Three distinctions came out of the read — inferring from a passage ('what does this sentence mean', the paired .read items, 'which sentence is correct') is not the easy end; a blank that tests a structure (passive, perfect, conditional, relative, reported speech, quantifier agreement) is the hard end while a blank that tests a word is the easy end; and a one-clause production task ('say what was reviewed') is not the hard end, only the two-move ones are.",
